{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who would\u2019ve thought that a roguelike, card game, and tower defence could unite over a basket of food?</strong> <br>In <strong>Snack Escort,</strong>\u00a0you will traverse magical lands filled with hungry creatures eager to snatch your precious cargo. Each run brings new challenges and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect cards and artifacts</strong> that shape how you face your enemies. Build your own deck of heroes, traps, and special abilities to fend off waves of foes. Your choices determine the fate of your basket and your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134230/extras/9bf505846b507db1b7496988e4ef2663.avif?t=1773054874\" width=600 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134230/extras/e05aa2ce1fcde50c7f4f607cf305086c.avif?t=1773054874\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set up defences and plan your moves like in tower defence.</strong> Place units and traps in strategic locations to protect your food. Each battle map is unique and demands new tactics and adaptability \u2014 the enemies never rest, and the world won\u2019t wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every run is an adventure.</strong> Discover new card combinations, acquire powerful artefacts, and overcome increasingly difficult waves of enemies. <i>Snack Escort</i> is for those who love challenges, strategic decisions, and a touch of humour in a whimsical fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add <i>Snack Escort</i></strong> to your wishlist and be the first to defend your precious basket when the journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134230/extras/029d1cf017b490a37060a585322b1316.gif?t=1773054874\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4134230/extras/029d1cf017b490a37060a585322b1316.poster.avif?t=1773054874\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/5087a4fd9f5692acefa438953930955475327e83.jpg"},{"name":"Mercenary","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/fe9dd47b70061da391cbeb64b558a9738dd10a88.jpg"},{"name":"Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/067c49e7145d45e6182ca0ab855dca81e2339d89.jpg"},{"name":"Strong defence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/919b38f54f922b28184a1f28bc0b0d10ca6f97d4.jpg"},{"name":"Rock defence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/d2b07784da3d3208ea24e4e7173d39b3779cecf3.jpg"},{"name":"Iron defence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/b8eeaa466e972061431e3375a0be6c5e6b5808e7.jpg"},{"name":"You shall not pass!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/6b93d5dcab995abc2974de6a7c1247874da38c8b.jpg"},{"name":"No passage here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/dfbc97468f8b3b95cd7d21d4bf56f0c952003987.jpg"},{"name":"Stun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4134230/3d0bea66a13b2367162c587c8e01adb4a192fc5a.jpg"},{"name":"Stun+","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st